media: qcom: camss: Settle in the middle of the D-PHY window.

The settle count waited only for the minimum T_HS-SETTLE, 85 ns + 6 UI.
With the OV8856 at 180 MHz (its 1640x1232 modes) on SM6115 the CSID
then counted CRC and ECC errors on every packet and no frame arrived.
The middle of the window, 115 ns + 8 UI, works at 180 and 360 MHz.

--- a/drivers/media/platform/qcom/camss/camss-csiphy-3ph-1-0.c	2026-10-27 17:41:21.602389960 +0300
+++ b/drivers/media/platform/qcom/camss/camss-csiphy-3ph-1-0.c	2026-10-27 17:41:21.614315669 +0300
@@ -894,7 +894,8 @@
 	ui = div_u64(1000000000000LL, link_freq);
 	ui /= 2;
 	t_hs_prepare_max = 85000 + 6 * ui;
-	t_hs_settle = t_hs_prepare_max;
+	/* The middle of the D-PHY window, 85 ns + 6 UI to 145 ns + 10 UI. */
+	t_hs_settle = 115000 + 8 * ui;
 
 	timer_period = div_u64(1000000000000LL, timer_clk_rate);
 	settle_cnt = t_hs_settle / timer_period - 6;
